            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If by \"unaccept\" here you mean the reverse of `apply_hunks`, then I am afraid it is not the part of 'mini.diff'. Maybe at least currently, see #2052 and [its this comment](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052#discussioncomment-14625414) for more details.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">If by \"unaccept\" here you mean the reverse of <code class=\"notranslate\">apply_hunks</code>, then I am afraid it is not the part of 'mini.diff'. Maybe at least currently, see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"8999611\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052\">#2052</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052#discussioncomment-14625414\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/2052/hovercard?comment_id=14625414\">its this comment</a> for more details.</p>",
